# One-off debug harnesses and screenshots (not part of the build)
dbg-*.mjs
debug-*.png
apps/desktop/debug-*.html
apps/desktop/src/debug-*/
# The debug-* directories under apps/desktop/src that were committed before this
# ignore rule stay tracked: a blanket ignore makes `git add` refuse them, and
# pre-commit's restage loop then aborts every commit that touches them.
!apps/desktop/src/debug-automation/
!apps/desktop/src/debug-genui/
!apps/desktop/src/debug-msg-actions/
!apps/desktop/src/debug-myself/
!apps/desktop/src/debug-trajectory/
# Same story one level up: these prototype/debug pages are tracked, so the
# blanket ignores below must not swallow them.
!apps/desktop/prototype-*.html
!apps/desktop/debug-*.html
